{"ref":"BDB, חֶזְקָה","hw":"חֶזְקָה","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">חֶזְקָה</span>]</big>  <strong>n.f. strength, force (</strong>strictly Inf. form from <span dir=\"rtl\">חזק</span> v. Ges<sup>§ 45. 1 b</sup><strong>)</strong>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  of urgency of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>’s hand in prophetic inspiration <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּחֶזְקַת הַיָּד֑</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 8:11\" href=\"/Isaiah.8.11\">Is 8:11</a> (cf. <a data-ref=\"BDB, חָזַק\" href=\"/BDB,_חָזַק\", dir=\"rtl\">חָזַק</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 3:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.3.14\">Ez 3:14</a>).<br><strong>2.</strong>  of royal power <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּחֶזְקָתוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 12:1\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.12.1\">2 Ch 12:1</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.16\">26:16</a> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">חָזַק</span> v <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 26:15\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.26.15\">15</a>), <a data-ref=\"Daniel 11:2\" href=\"/Daniel.11.2\">Dn 11:2</a>.","next":"BDB, חֹ֫זֶק","prev":"BDB, חֵ֫זֶק"}